[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.11, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "啊，就是這樣。 「嗯。我的意思是，所以我就想，嗯，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11654.469, "timestamp": "03:14:14", "text": "我把那些惡意的話說得更惡毒，那它們就真的惡毒了，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11659.683, "timestamp": "03:14:19", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's crazy.... I guess that's why things often get taken out of context"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11672.07, "timestamp": "03:14:32", "text": "對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11674.71, "timestamp": "03:14:34", "text": "對。只要我不讓它們傷害我，它們就傷不了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.429, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "我從小就有這種想法，你知道，在學校裡，別人會說一些難聽的話。對"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11689.59, "timestamp": "03:14:49", "text": "。當他們用這些話來形容我的時候，我只是想我。沒有，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11695.83, "timestamp": "03:14:55", "text": "。 「怎麼樣？這到底是什麼東西？例如，你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11698.827, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmao"}]